  "id": "RAW_98fc75e480",
  "title": "Google：AI 智能体在无人协助下将安全补丁转化为可用漏洞利用程序",
  "url": "https://www.theregister.com/research/2026/11/16/google-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help/5309926",
  "date": "2026-11-16 22:00:00",
  "author": "sshah03",
  "siteName": "Hacker News - Newest: \"AI Agent\"",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <section class=\"main article k5a-article\" id=\"main\">\n   <div data-element-guid=\"d11159dd-82a3-4c53-901c-d41dec75505c\" class=\"articleHeader column\">\n    <a data-tag=\"research\" href=\"https://www.theregister.com/tag/research\" class=\"lab-article-section-link\"> \n     <p style=\"\" class=\" lab-article-section lab-article-section-top \">research</p> \n    </a>\n    <div class=\"media\"></div>\n    <p class=\"subtitle below\" style=\"\">Look ma, no human in the loop!</p>\n    <div data-element-guid=\"07410499-2665-44c7-ab99-ccf53f1dde69\" class=\"meta\">\n     <div class=\"bylines\">\n      <div data-element-guid=\"c9750855-7036-497e-893b-87380d518223\" class=\"byline column\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n       <div class=\"content\">\n        <address class=\"name lab-name-flex\"><span class=\"lab-hidden-byline-name\" itemprop=\"name\">Jessica Lyons</span> <a rel=\"author\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"https://www.theregister.com/author/jessica-lyons\"> <span class=\"firstname \">Jessica</span> <span class=\"lastname \">Lyons</span> </a> <span class=\"lab-job-title\" itemprop=\"jobTitle\">Cybersecurity Editor</span></address>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"dates\">\n      <span class=\"dateGroup datePublished\"> <span class=\"dateLabel\">Published</span> <time datetime=\"2026-11-16T14:00:00.000Z\">mon 16 Nov 2026 // 14:00 UTC</time> </span>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"social\">\n      <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-social-twitter\" aria-label=\"Share on X (Twitter)\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-social-linkedin\" aria-label=\"Share on LinkedIn\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:?subject=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help&amp;body=Look%20ma%2C%20no%20human%20in%20the%20loop!%0Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-mail\" aria-label=\"Share by email\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bsky.app/intent/compose?text=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-social-bluesky\" aria-label=\"Share on Bluesky\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926&amp;title=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help\" class=\"fi-social-reddit\" aria-label=\"Share on Reddit\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?text=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-social-whatsapp\" aria-label=\"Share on WhatsApp\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://t.me/share/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926&amp;text=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help\" class=\"fi-social-telegram\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://google.com/preferences/source?q=theregister.com\" class=\"fi-social-google-preferred\">Make us preferred on Google</a>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div data-element-guid=\"4c9dc5d9-c886-4348-bf4a-01d0dc71377d\" class=\"bodytext large-12 small-12 medium-12\">\n    <!-- placeholder(#1) -->\n    <div data-element-guid=\"1ea2b5a8-71e5-47bb-8230-fdbe53654e82\" class=\"column articlesByTag toplist desktop-floatRight mobile-floatRight small-12 large-3 small-abs-12 large-abs-3\">\n     <div class=\"content \" style=\"\">\n      <h3 itemprop=\"headline\" class=\"t21 font-weight-bold m-font-weight-bold bg-primary color_mobile_bg-primary align-center mobile_text_align_align-center font-RobotoMono hasTextPadding mobile-hasTextPadding\" style=\"\">READ MORE</h3>\n      <ul>\n       <li><a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/14/big-tech-takes-a-beating-as-online-safety-experts-accuse-companies-of-doing-bare-minimum/5309302\"> \n         <div class=\"text-container\">\n          <h4 class=\"abt-title\">Big Tech takes a beating as online safety experts accuse companies of doing bare minimum</h4>\n          <time datetime=\"2 days ago\" class=\"publishedTime fi-clock\">2 days ago</time>\n         </div> \n        </a></li>\n       <li><a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/13/this-years-bug-count-just-passed-100k/5309882\"> \n         <div class=\"text-container\">\n          <h4 class=\"abt-title\">This year’s bug count just passed 100K</h4>\n          <time datetime=\"2 days ago\" class=\"publishedTime fi-clock\">2 days ago</time>\n         </div> \n        </a></li>\n       <li><a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/13/quantum-systems-drones-back-in-the-air-after-malware-scare/5309658\"> \n         <div class=\"text-container\">\n          <h4 class=\"abt-title\">Quantum Systems drones back in the air after malware scare</h4>\n          <time datetime=\"3 days ago\" class=\"publishedTime fi-clock\">3 days ago</time>\n         </div> \n        </a></li>\n       <li><a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/13/crackdown-on-uk-medical-record-snooping-after-staff-reported-sneaking-300-times-this-year/5309421\"> \n         <div class=\"text-container\">\n          <h4 class=\"abt-title\">Crackdown on UK medical record snooping after staff reported sneaking 300+ times this year</h4>\n          <time datetime=\"3 days ago\" class=\"publishedTime fi-clock\">3 days ago</time>\n         </div> \n        </a></li>\n       <li><a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/13/brit-police-watchdog-says-cops-use-of-facial-recog-risks-wrongful-arrests/5309379\"> \n         <div class=\"text-container\">\n          <h4 class=\"abt-title\">Brit police watchdog says cops' use of facial recog risks wrongful arrests</h4>\n          <time datetime=\"3 days ago\" class=\"publishedTime fi-clock\">3 days ago</time>\n         </div> \n        </a></li>\n      </ul>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <p>A suspected Russian-speaking operator used an AI agent to turn security patches into working exploits with no human in the loop – a first such occurrence, according to the Google Threat Intelligence Group (GTIG) – before ultimately stealing data from victim organizations.</p>\n    <p>Google documented this attack in its fourth-quarter 2026 AI threat tracker, and said it marks a significant advance in how attackers use LLMs for fully autonomous vulnerability discovery and exploitation compared to Q3.</p>\n    <p>In this case, the threat hunters found an exposed staging server hosting a multi-agent vulnerability research and weaponization framework that integrates with multiple frontier and local models. The framework, called <span class=\"font-RobotoMono \" data-lab-fontface=\"RobotoMono\">exploit_agent,</span> used Russian-language tooling, and was configured to conduct continuous differential analysis of “popular web application software,” according to the <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/agentic-threat-activity-crosses-a-significant-threshold\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">report</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n    <div data-element-guid=\"bc057009-4dc7-43f8-846b-44d56eb5fa58\" class=\"column google-ad widthFull\" style=\"\">\n     <span class=\"ad-label\">REG AD</span>\n    </div>\n    <p>This includes comparing code before and after security updates, identifying potential vulnerabilities, developing exploits, and then automatically executing them without any human involvement.</p>\n    <div data-element-guid=\"af23b3aa-2e4b-4e78-b75a-a1f71f44f41b\" class=\"column google-ad floatRight widthAuto\" style=\"\">\n     <span class=\"ad-label\">REG AD</span>\n    </div>\n    <p>The server also contained data stolen from victim organizations, and “multiple” post-compromise scripts that allowed attackers to perform nefarious activities including internal reconnaissance, brute-forcing, installing webshells, and removing other attackers’ webshells.&nbsp;</p>\n    <p>“Victim telemetry on the server suggests the operator was specifically interested in targeting French websites associated with the media and entertainment industries, as well as the education sector,” according to the report.</p>\n    <p>The report also documents other instances of attackers moving beyond manual LLM prompting during cyberattacks and instead deploying autonomous, multi-agent offensive security frameworks to carry out multi-stage intrusions. These include both financially motivated cybercriminals and cyber-espionage groups.</p>\n    <p>In addition to the <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/cyber-crime/2026/10/28/123-reg-discloses-ai-cyberattack-on-customer-data-suspects-china-nexus/5305936\">recent attacks</a> involving the open source penetration-testing tool ARTEX, attackers have also used other AI-powered offensive frameworks, including <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/09/25/crook-used-three-open-source-agents-to-break-into-a-fortune-500-hospitality-company-a-major-us-airline-and-25-other-orgs/5299012\">CAIRN</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/06/threat-actor-targets-indian-fintechs-on-weekends-when-defenders-arent-watching/5308000\">CyberStrikeAI</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2025/09/03/crims-boast-of-using-hexstrike-ai-against-citrix-bugs/368681\">HexStrike AI</a>, and PentAGI. In another instance, GTIG observed attackers using PentAGI alongside proxy services to target the aerospace sector.</p>\n    <p>“We have observed several threat actors separately experimenting with use of these frameworks and harnesses, including financially motivated, as well as suspected espionage threat actors with a PRC nexus,” the Googlers wrote. “Given the low barrier to entry, ease of integrating new exploits, and massive scaling potential, we believe it is highly likely that threat actors will continue to use these frameworks in campaigns targeting organizations globally.” ®</p>\n   </div>\n   <div data-element-guid=\"7475c074-83b3-4e50-ab01-91bf62dcdfe6\" class=\"column articleFooter\">\n    <span class=\"tags\"> <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/tag/google\" data-tag=\"google\">google</a> <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/tag/security\" data-tag=\"security\">security</a> <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/tag/research\" data-tag=\"research\">research</a> </span>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"row social\">\n    <div class=\"column large-12 small-12\">\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-social-twitter\" aria-label=\"Share on X (Twitter)\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-social-linkedin\" aria-label=\"Share on LinkedIn\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:?subject=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help&amp;body=Look%20ma%2C%20no%20human%20in%20the%20loop!%0Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-mail\" aria-label=\"Share by email\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bsky.app/intent/compose?text=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-social-bluesky\" aria-label=\"Share on Bluesky\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926&amp;title=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help\" class=\"fi-social-reddit\" aria-label=\"Share on Reddit\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?text=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926\" class=\"fi-social-whatsapp\" aria-label=\"Share on WhatsApp\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://t.me/share/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2Fresearch%2F2026%2F11%2F16%2Fgoogle-ai-agent-turned-a-security-patch-into-a-working-exploit-with-no-human-help%2F5309926&amp;text=Google%3A%20AI%20agent%20turned%20a%20security%20patch%20into%20a%20working%20exploit%20with%20no%20human%20help\" class=\"fi-social-telegram\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://google.com/preferences/source?q=theregister.com\" class=\"fi-social-google-preferred\">Make us preferred on Google</a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Google 威胁情报小组记录了一名讲俄语的攻击者利用自主 AI 智能体将安全补丁转化为可用漏洞利用程序，全程无需人工干预，这标志着 AI 驱动的网络攻击行动显著升级。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Google 威胁情报小组记录了一名讲俄语的攻击者利用自主 AI 智能体将安全补丁转化为可用漏洞利用程序，全程无需人工干预，这标志着 AI 驱动的网络攻击行动显著升级。",
  "summary": "Google 威胁情报小组（GTIG）记录了一起首创攻击：一名讲俄语的威胁行为者部署了名为 exploit_agent 的自主 AI 智能体，在无人参与的情况下将安全补丁转化为可用漏洞利用程序。该框架持续对流行的 Web 应用软件进行差异分析，通过对比安全更新前后的代码来识别漏洞、开发漏洞利用程序并自动执行。攻击者窃取了受害组织的数据，并部署入侵后脚本，用于侦察、暴力破解、安装 Webshell 和清除攻击者。受害者包括法国媒体、娱乐和教育行业的网站。GTIG 还观察到，类似的自主多智能体框架，如 CAIRN、CyberStrikeAI、HexStrike AI 和 PentAGI，正被以经济利益为目的的犯罪分子以及与中国有关联的间谍团体使用。这凸显了此类 AI 驱动攻击工具的低门槛和巨大扩展潜力。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "首次记录到 AI 自主生成漏洞利用程序",
      "explanation": "这是已知首例 AI 智能体在完全无人参与的情况下将安全补丁转化为可用漏洞利用程序的案例，显示出自主漏洞发现与武器化能力的重大进展。"
    },
    {
      "point": "用于持续差异分析的多智能体框架",
      "explanation": "exploit_agent 框架整合了前沿模型和本地模型，持续分析 Web 应用中的代码变更，无需人工提示或监督即可自动识别漏洞并开发漏洞利用程序。"
    },
    {
      "point": "AI 驱动的网络攻击行动升级",
      "explanation": "Google 记录了多个由 AI 驱动的攻击框架（CAIRN、CyberStrikeAI、HexStrike AI、PentAGI）被以经济利益为目的的犯罪分子和国家支持的行为者使用，表明不同类型的威胁行为者正广泛采用自主攻击工具。"
    },
    {
      "point": "门槛低、扩展潜力巨大",
      "explanation": "新漏洞利用程序易于集成，加上框架具备扩展能力，使这些 AI 驱动的攻击工具很容易被全球各地的威胁行为者获取。这意味着它们未来很可能会在网络攻击活动中进一步扩散。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "「看吧，整个流程里一个人都没有！」",
    "「服务器上的受害者遥测数据表明，操作者似乎特别关注法国网站，目标涉及媒体和娱乐行业以及教育领域。」",
    "「鉴于入门门槛低、新漏洞利用程序易于集成，且扩展潜力巨大，我们认为威胁行为者极有可能继续在针对全球各地组织的攻击活动中使用这些框架。」"
  ],
